WEBVTT

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.200
Human's Shopping Channel!

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:18.240
Hey, Florence! My bed's so firm,
I can't get a wink of sleep at night.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.750
Florence

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.750
Bianco

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.790
Oh, Bianco, I'm sure there's no price
too high you'd pay to remedy that.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.160
I have just the item for you!

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.950
Wow! My goodness, Florence!

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.450
This water-filled mattress
is so bouncy and comfy!

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.490
You'll sleep soundly with this waterbed!

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.200
Say goodbye to nights of fitful sleep!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.200
Florence, you--no, this waterbed is amazing!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.700
I want one!

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
Why's she watching TV here?

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.950
Wait, I didn't know we got human channels here.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:55.120
I see, I can simply purchase high-tech goods
instead of making them myself.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.700
I'll order it now.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.950
Telepathic Black Crystal

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.120
Hi, this is Human's Shopping Channel!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.580
Thank you for shopping with us!
May I have your address?

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.240
The Demon Castle.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:16.290
Oh... the Demon Castle is not
within our area of delivery.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.790
Even product distribution here is rubbish!

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.080
--That's wonderful.
--Isn't it?
--Indeed.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.330
What happened here?!

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:33.740
You see, the princess...

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:41.450
This week, the hostage princess has committed
14 counts of vandalization, 22 counts of theft,

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.790
and 18 counts of violence toward a demon.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.870
It's too awful.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:50.080
It's abnormal for a hostage to be
walking about freely in the first place.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:54.040
Though I was already aware,
it's time to acknowledge it.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:58.410
We have been far too lenient with the hostage!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:00.890
Hostage Training Week

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.040
It's time to tighten the reigns.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:05.330
But didn't we scrap the plan to put
more stringent measures on her cell

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:10.080
to avoid the risk of further
drawing out her abilities?

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.620
Then how can we make the princess
realize she's a hostage?

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:19.950
How about giving her the cold shoulder?
Ignore her like we would a hostage.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.450
That's it! As part of Hostage Training Week,

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.790
I hereby order the Demon Castle's
residents to ignore the princess

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.870
to make her act more like a hostage!

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:33.750
"Quest"
"Ignore the Princess"

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.660
I'll just have to make it with my own two hands!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:45.040
"Quest"
"Sleep on a Comfortable Waterbed"

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:19.990
"Ninth Night"
"The Princess and Hostage Training Week"

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.910
To assemble it,

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:25.990
Water demon's shed skin

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:27.740
I'll first fill this object from the item storage with water,

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.740
then support the bed with a wooden frame.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:41.830
Now, all I require is a tool to drill holes
into the wood and an elastic rope!

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:56.160
What's this? They didn't yell at me,
and I went past them without a hitch.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:04.700
H-Hey, how do you ignore a princess?
Was that correct?

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.950
I don't know. Probably, I guess.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.370
This really isn't my thing.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.280
Peaceful

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:13.490
Wait, the order came from
the top brass. Let's go ask them.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:14.290
Item Storage

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:14.330
Item Storage

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:14.370
Item Storage

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:14.410
Item Storage

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:14.460
Item Storage

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:14.500
Item Storage

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:14.540
Item Storage

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:14.580
Item Storage

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:14.620
Item Storage

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:14.660
Item Storage

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:14.710
Item Storage

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:14.750
Item Storage

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:14.790
Item Storage

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:15.920
Item Storage

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.080
You there, move aside.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.740
Can't you see me?

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:26.330
That's how you do it!
You ignore her with firm resolve!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.200
So that's the trick.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.040
Look, she backed down.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.540
Sh-She's treating him like a dog!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.040
Well, he <i>is</i> a dog.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.660
But he's still able to ignore her! Wow!

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.450
The top brass really are amazi--

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.540
What's going on?

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.740
What are you're doing?

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:03.200
It's not what you think. If I resist,
I may accidentally harm her.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.910
How many phi are your horns?

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.330
Φ = Unit of measure for diameter

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.330
What?!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.870
No. Ignore her. Just ignore her.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.490
Princess, you've scraped your knee!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.700
What the heck are those two doing?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.240
Demon King!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:38.990
This is pathetic! I'll show you
how to truly ignore someone!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.370
How many phi are your horns?

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.450
What?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.540
Taking her pets on a walk?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.660
No, she's the <i>hostage</i> princess!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.830
It's no good.
The top brass won't be of any help.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.120
Nope.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.830
Wow, she even made pets
of the demon king and big ten.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.700
The princess is super popular!

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.700
Nobody there to retort

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:09.160
These three will provide fangs
and horns to drill holes,

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.330
but I'm not sure I'll find an elastic rope.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:19.080
I've been watching you three.
What in the world have you been doing?!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.580
Simply staying quiet doesn't
mean you're ignoring her!

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:25.700
We can explain...

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.580
We'll hurt the princess if we pull too hard!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.700
Why don't you just cut the rope then?!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.580
Oh, yeah.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:35.120
Stretchy... rope.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:32.950
You <i>just</i> realized this?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.120
There were unforeseen circumstances...

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.490
Unforeseen?!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:40.080
Even though she leashed us,
we didn't talk to her!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.580
That defeats the purpose of ignoring her!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:43.790
Ignoring?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.520
Sorry.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.540
I'm sorry.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.740
My apologies.

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.240
You were ignoring me?

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.620
Just yawned

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.700
We... We made her cry!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.540
That's not it!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.660
Good. Holes are all drilled.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.410
My horns...

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.380
Helped out of guilt

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.490
My fangs...

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.490
Plus, I got my rope.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.140
Offered out of guilt

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:15.330
It wasn't me...

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:19.240
I drew water from the pipe
and plugged the pipe up again.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.020
Offered out of guilt?

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.200
Are you leaving me here?!

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:25.790
But I wonder why...
The demons didn't get in my way today

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.580
and were actually quite helpful.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:31.040
Rather than ignore me,
they monitored me closely.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.490
It must be thanks to them.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.490
I successfully constructed my water bed!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.040
Zzz...

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:53.420
Quest Complete

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.950
Slept comfortably.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.870
Ignoring her... is no good!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.950
It'll kill us before anything else.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.950
Huh? What's up?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.240
I agree.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:09.690
"Quest Failed"

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.620
Try harder next time!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:14.700
Neo Alraune

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.620
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.290
But still, we need her to be more
aware of the fact that she's a hostage.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:23.830
So we came to you.
What do you think we should do, Hades?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:27.370
You call yourselves
the demon king and his forces?

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.120
Basically, it's because your hostage
has too much time on her hands.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.080
Put her to work to deprive her of freedom.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.950
Yes! Yes, that's it, Hades!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:42.700
More importantly, today's the day to see
who's fit to be the real demon king--

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:46.790
From this day forth, we shall force
the hostage princess to work!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.660
I forbid anyone to give her aid!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.740
"Quest"
"Deprive the Princess of Freedom by Forcing Her to Work"

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:58.870
These are due in a month!
Make sure to hand them in!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:04.290
It may seem like a great amount,
but you'll finish if you do a little each day...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.540
Princess?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.290
Is this work?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:12.450
Hm? Indeed, assigned by the demon king himself.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.290
I see.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:16.290
All right, then. Finish them on time.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:23.910
I have something to do other than sleep!

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.410
Thinking back, it was always
like this back at my castle.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:33.540
Heaps of papers... a barrage
of pointless approval requests.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:37.330
But I can finish this amount off in a day!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.990
"Quest"
"Finish All Work"

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:45.990
Demon Castle Mess Hall

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:51.450
It's the princess.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.330
But there's something different about her.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.540
And she's not in her usual pajamas.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:57.080
She's in work mode?!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.580
Uh, Princess?

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:01.870
What?

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:05.990
I heard that they dumped a bunch of work on you.

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:07.910
But why are you doing it here?

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:11.450
It's less lonely here.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:12.790
How old are you?!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:16.330
B-But look at how fast she's working!

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.290
Wow.

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:21.450
I heard the higher-ups gave her
enough work for a month.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.040
What kind of work did they give her anyway?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.540
Math drills?

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.120
A book report?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.160
I don't have materials to make my safety poster!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:37.830
It <i>is</i> summer vacation homework!

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:41.160
Hey, Princess.
Is this really the work they gave you?

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.490
This homework--

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:45.080
Not homework. It's <i>work</i> .

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.080
She's taking so much pride in it!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.830
Just what are the bosses thinking?

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:54.160
Well, at least it's better than giving her
important Demon Castle documents.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:57.160
And she is quieter than usual.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.160
She's gone!

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:00.160
Over there!

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:06.120
She's... She's observing the flower?!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.070
Demon Realm plant Mangorashia

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.450
I know, for her observation diary!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.870
I see.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.290
Seems more violent than I remember.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.200
What's she doing now?

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:19.210
Picture diary

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:17.740
That's a normal picture diary!

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.580
She's working rapidly.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:26.580
"Today was a wonderful and uneventful day."

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.220
No substance

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.370
She's writing the same thing over and over!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.790
Hang on, she's writing the whole
month's worth in one go!

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.120
That's cheating!

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:37.290
Nope. The instructions don't say I must
write about a different day on each page.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.700
Which means I can split
a single day into seconds

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.870
and write about each as
31 separate topics.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:46.450
This princess is a chop logic beast.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:51.540
Why is she working so hard
to finish her work, anyway?

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.330
Huh?

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.990
I mean, she usually never does anything we say.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:58.370
It's only natural.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:05.660
Isn't this work? A princess may not sleep
until she finishes all her work.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:08.790
She's suddenly exposing
the darkness of her home life!

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:13.520
Model

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.580
Next... Next is crafts.

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:18.830
Don't you kinda feel sorry for her?

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:23.370
Forced to work all day on public affairs
at home. And now working in her captivity.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.490
Yeah...

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.200
Yeah, I do.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:30.200
Next... Next is a research project.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:39.410
Say, Princess. The boss said not to help,
but let us give you a hand anyway.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:44.620
Adults usually help out
for research projects, right?

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:47.080
Come on, so what's your topic?

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:51.120
You guys... Th-Thank you.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:57.120
That means... That means
I'll be able to sleep tonight.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.660
Research Topic: Which Demon Skins Are Best for Bedding?

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.790
What? You finished?

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:08.660
Yeah.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.490
In one day?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.540
Yeah.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.120
The whole month's worth?!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.240
Yeah.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.330
It's been so long since I've felt this.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.950
This used to be the norm for me.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:25.790
I'm pretty tired, but it's nice once in a while.

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:30.410
My bed after finishing a long day's work.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.700
Zzz...

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:43.190
Quest Complete

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.740
Well done!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:46.660
What?! Did we miscalculate
the amount to assign?!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:50.370
I can't believe she completed
this all in one day.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.700
Fire Safety

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.910
Quality of the work aside...

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.830
...this figure seems to be running
around and setting things on fire.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.160
At this rate, it'll be more of a burden
to come up with assignments.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.290
Moreover, the demons
will suffer terrible injury.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:08.830
Very well. We will no longer
give the princess work.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:16.640
"Quest Failed"

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.790
Try harder next time!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:27.370
Come to think, everything they
assigned was children's homework.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:30.910
How old do they think I am?

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:36.990
Poseidon

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.540
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.200
I don't ask for much.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:45.740
I just want something to show that we've
made the princess more hostage-like.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:46.990
Demon King...

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:51.240
What?! Human bandits
broke into the North Fortress?

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:53.330
Affirmative! But they've been captured.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.740
Take them prisoner and bring them to the castle?

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:56.740
That's it!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:57.910
There's no need.

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.580
Wait!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.200
Bring the bandits here
and lock them in our prison!

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.160
Demon King?

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:07.620
We'll show the princess what
normal human prisoners are like

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.290
so she'll learn how to be
a proper hostage from them!

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:14.540
"Quest"
"Teach the Princess How to Be a Proper Hostage"

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:20.540
Prison for Hostages

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:18.370
Let me out!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.450
Please, don't hurt me!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.740
Humans?

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:27.160
Perhaps this is too brutal for the princess.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:30.450
Nah, the shock of it will be good for her.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:33.740
Humans. I haven't seen one in a while.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:41.910
But look at these conditions.
Hard straw mat beds, cramped cells, and no view.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:45.290
Could... Could it be?

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:46.580
Are you going to eat them?

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.200
They're prisoners, you dolt!

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.990
How could you think such a thing?

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:52.790
But with these accommodations...

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:57.450
Princess, I hate to say this,
but you're a special case.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.410
This is the norm for regular
hostages and prisoners.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.540
Shocked Princess

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:08.950
She's extremely shocked.

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:15.580
But with such cramped quarters,
do they go out for walks?

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:20.330
They're not allowed.
Besides, they're terribly afraid of demons.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.700
Goes on walks daily

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.740
She's shocked again.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.740
Then what about dinner requests?

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.200
Yeah, right! They're captives!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.700
Requests often

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:38.830
What's so shocking?!
Oh, right, you think you're here on vacation!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:42.700
Anyway, Princess, you don't have
to be exactly like them,

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.790
but watch them and learn
to act more hostage-like.

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:54.080
I see. If he says that's
the proper way to behave...

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.950
...I must put effort into
acting more hostage-like!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:01.620
"Quest"
"Learn to Behave Like a Hostage"

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.370
All right, here's your food.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.700
No, a monster! Don't hurt me!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:11.330
I guess this is enemy territory.
That is the usual reaction?

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.290
I won't hurt you. Sheesh.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.290
No, a monster.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.450
Oh... yeah...

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.540
You're not! No, you're not.
There's a reason why she said that.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.740
Princess, tell him you were just copying them.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.330
Here's your food.

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:37.740
Don't hurt me!

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:38.740
What?

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.700
Don't hurt me!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.370
Hey, the bull's happy again!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.120
The demon's been badly influenced, too!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.660
Be like a hostage. Be like a hostage.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:56.830
She's entering an empty cell!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.040
Hey, isn't that girl a human?

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.080
Demons are scary!

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.160
Princess! That's it! You're doing it!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.080
Parents

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.870
Good, be like that all the time.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:13.120
Don't come any closer!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.340
Thoroughly acting the hostage

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:17.990
What do you plan to do with me locked up in here?

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:20.290
W-Well, you walked in yourself--

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.450
Return me to my mother and father!

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.450
D-Demon King, is this...

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.700
No, it's fine. This is how it should be.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:34.490
Just like that, Princess! We're enemies--

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:38.410
Of course we are!
Don't speak to me like we're friends!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:45.740
First, you abduct me in my sleep!
Absolutely despicable! An abominable deed!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.490
Demon King!

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.580
The demon king has died! Mentally!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.240
However, this is what the demon king wished for.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.370
What a ghastly bed.

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:01.410
Princess, you don't have to go that far.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.370
If you sleep there, the rough straw will--

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:08.160
Y-You were still looking?!
So you're keeping surveillance of me, are you?

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.620
Don't look at me! You'll turn me demon!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.240
Planetary Alignment

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:27.120
Stop, please... We were wrong.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.950
But I tried so hard to do what he asked!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.490
What was all this for, anyway?

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:46.740
She defeated the demons. She ain't human.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:53.870
In the end, they actually want me
to behave as I normally do.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:57.330
It means my way of behaving
as a hostage was correct.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:04.290
Then I'll show them...
my uninhibited hostage life!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:11.830
Behold! My hostage princess sleeping technique!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.040
Zzz...

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.910
Heave-ho.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:22.120
So, is she any different?

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:28.870
Hey, return the potions you stole
from the item storage!

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.490
Don't hurt me!

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:36.660
She now acts the hostage only
when it's convenient for her.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:37.870
You okay with that?

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:48.280
Quest Complete

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.580
Well done!

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.830
Good job... was it?!

00:21:54.450 --> 00:22:02.580
But still... the demons are kind,
even if I don't scream, "Don't hurt me!"

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:09.450
Say, why do humans and demons fight?

00:23:42.990 --> 00:23:48.410
A rude awakening means to have
a surprising or unpleasant discovery.

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:51.700
Why do I mention this now?

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:54.580
Next time, "The Princess in Endopolis."

00:23:54.580 --> 00:23:56.160
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
